@startuml Sequence Diagram - View Message History

actor "TeamMember" as TeamMember
participant "ConversationDetailView" as ConvDetailView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

TeamMember -> ConvDetailView : 1 Open conversation detail page
activate ConvDetailView
ConvDetailView -> ConvDetailView : 2 Display message history

ConvDetailView -> ClerkAuth : 3 Request message history
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 4 Fetch message records
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 5 Retrieve message history
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 6 Return message data
ClerkAuth -> ConvDetailView : 7 Return message info
ConvDetailView -> TeamMember : 8 Display message history

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate ConvDetailView

@enduml
